## Claude Code harness workers

- Delegate with `node .harness/run.mjs brief [ID]` and the `harness-worker` subagent (`.claude/agents/harness-worker.md`). A named subagent starts fresh; a fork inherits this transcript, so don't fork for harness work.
- The worker runs `claim`, which prints its worker ID, and passes `--worker-id ID` on every later mutation (`start`, `verify`, `checkpoint`, `handoff`).
